 "title": "The 1740 Batavia Massacre",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🩸",
 "sentences": [
  "At least 10,000 people were massacred in 1740.",
  "The Dutch East India Company and allied groups targeted ethnic Chinese residents in Batavia.",
  "Rising unrest was fueled by government repression and falling sugar prices.",
  "After Chinese workers killed 50 Dutch soldiers, authorities confiscated weapons and imposed a curfew.",
  "Soon, rumors of atrocities sparked mass arson and cannon fire against Chinese homes.",
  "Only 600 to 3,000 residents managed to survive the deadly violence."
